# Terraform
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
.terraform/
# tfvars: ignore all EXCEPT the committed per-env baselines (explicit allowlist).
# Order matters — broad ignore first, then the specific re-includes (last match wins).
# Personal/experimental overrides go in `*.auto.tfvars` (auto-loaded, stays local).
*.tfvars
!infra/environments/dev/terraform.tfvars
!infra/environments/prod/terraform.tfvars
# Backend config names an account's state bucket; each operator writes their own
# from the committed *.hcl.example (lock files are .terraform.lock.hcl, unaffected).
infra/bootstrap/backend-*.hcl
infra/environments/*/backend.hcl
# Lambda build artifacts (terraform-aws-modules/lambda emits zips here) + saved plans
infra/environments/*/builds/
*.tfplan
tfplan.bin
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

